export default "import { Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\n\n<Meta title=\"Docs/Figma Make Pipeline\" />\n\n# Figma Make Pipeline\n\n> *Design-to-code pipeline: Figma Make export → transform rules → flat component structure.*\n\n**Status: ⚠️ Manual extraction active — automation planned**\n\n---\n\n## Pipeline Flow\n\n```\nFigma Make export (.zip)\n        │\n        ▼\nFIGMA-imports/          ← Unzip here (staging)\n        │\n        ▼  Apply transformation rules\n        │\nfrontend/src/           ← Final destination\n  ├── components/       ← ALL components, FLAT\n  ├── imports/          ← SVG path files\n  ├── assets/           ← PNG, SVG static files\n  └── types.ts          ← Shared TypeScript types\n```\n\n---\n\n## Directory Rules (Non-Negotiable)\n\nThese rules exist because Figma Make exports a nested `/app/` structure with scoped CSS modules and `@/` path aliases. None of that works in our flat Vite project.\n\n| Rule | ✅ Correct | ❌ Wrong |\n|------|-----------|---------|\n| No `/app/` folder | `frontend/src/components/` | `frontend/src/app/components/` |\n| Flat components | `components/MyComponent.tsx` | `components/subfolder/MyComponent.tsx` |\n| Shared types | `components/types.ts` | `types/MyComponent.types.ts` |\n| Imports | `import * as React from 'react'` | `import React from 'react'` |\n| Component imports | `./ComponentName` | `@/components/ComponentName` |\n| No CSS files | Zero `.css` or `.module.css` | `styles.module.css` |\n| Named exports | `export function ComponentName` | `export default function` |\n\n---\n\n## Phases\n\n### Phase 1: Manual extraction ✅ Current\n\nManual unzip → transform → copy cycle. Each component checked against the 8-point checklist. Documented in `FIGMA-imports/For-Figma-AI-Propmt.md`.\n\n**Process:**\n1. Export from Figma Make as .zip\n2. Unzip into `FIGMA-imports/`\n3. For each component file:\n   - Remove `/app/` from all import paths\n   - Replace `@/` with `./`\n   - Delete any `.css` or `.module.css` files\n   - Convert `export default` to `export function`\n   - Move to `frontend/src/components/`\n4. Move SVG path files to `frontend/src/imports/`\n5. Move static assets to `frontend/src/assets/`\n6. Consolidate types into `frontend/src/components/types.ts`\n\n### Phase 2: Automation script 🔜\n\nA Node.js script that takes a `.zip` file, extracts it, applies all transformation rules, and outputs clean, flat components ready for the project.\n\n```bash\npnpm figma:import ./export.zip\n```\n\nThe script should:\n- Unzip to temp directory\n- Walk all `.tsx` files\n- Apply regex transformations for import paths\n- Delete `.css` files\n- Extract types to shared `types.ts`\n- Move files to correct directories\n- Run a final validation pass\n\n**Status:** Not started\n\n### Phase 3: CI integration 💡\n\nGitHub Action triggers on push to `FIGMA-imports/`:\n- Runs the automation script\n- Opens a PR for review\n- Runs the 8-point checklist as a CI check\n- Blocks merge if any rule fails\n\n**Status:** Not started\n\n---\n\n## Assets Already Integrated\n\n### Components\n`ImageWithFallback.tsx`, `FigmaCard.tsx`, `FigmaComponentBrowser.tsx`, `FigmaComponentViewer.tsx`\n\n### SVG Paths\n`svg-qb5kclrae4.ts`, `svg-2eefhakq49.ts` + 30+ more in `frontend/src/imports/`\n\n### Static Assets\n8 card PNG assets in `frontend/src/assets/` and `frontend/src/components/`\n\n---\n\n## Pending Extraction\n\n| Source (Figma Make) | Target Component | Status |\n|---------------------|-----------------|--------|\n| App.tsx → PromptCard | `components/PromptCard.tsx` | Needs transform |\n| App.tsx → Group8747 | `components/PromptGallery.tsx` | Needs transform |\n\n---\n\n## 8-Point Checklist\n\nEvery component must pass before landing in `frontend/src/components/`:\n\n- [ ] All components in `frontend/src/components/` — flat, no subfolders\n- [ ] Every React import is `import * as React from 'react'`\n- [ ] Every component import uses `./ComponentName`\n- [ ] Zero paths containing `/app/`\n- [ ] Zero `@/` paths\n- [ ] Zero `.css` or `.module.css` files\n- [ ] All shared types in `./types.ts`\n- [ ] All exports are named `export function`\n\n---\n\n## Relevant Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `FIGMA-imports/` | Staging directory for Figma exports |\n| `FIGMA-imports/For-Figma-AI-Propmt.md` | Detailed extraction instructions |\n| `frontend/src/components/` | Flat component destination |\n| `frontend/src/imports/` | SVG path files |\n| `frontend/src/assets/` | Static PNG/SVG assets |\n| `frontend/src/components/types.ts` | Shared TypeScript types |\n"